 598+ 6957              ;   4. Patch ptr de la entry a BgGfx_old_church_door_closed
 599+ 6957              ;   5. Cargar CLOSED + DrawBgSpriteXOR + DrawBgAttrOnly -> dibuja closed
 600+ 6957              ;   6. ChurchDoorOpen = 0
 601+ 6957              ; ==============================================================================
