 165+ 6A77                  ; Preservar BC: los callers (DrawScreen) usan B=x_char, C=y_char y
 166+ 6A77                  ; esperan que siga intacto tras la carga. Lo salvamos al principio.
 167+ 6A77 C5               PUSH BC
 168+ 6A78                  ; IFF tracking via StartupComplete (RAM) - evita race del LD A,I
 169+ 6A78 F3               DI
 170+ 6A79                  ; Page bank deseado inline
 171+ 6A79 3A D4 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 172+ 6A7C E6 F8            AND $F8
