 174+ 6A7F 3A 03 6B         LD A, (.lbsBankSave)
 175+ 6A82 E6 07            AND $07                         ; safety: solo bits 0-2
 176+ 6A84 B0               OR B                            ; merge bank en paging
 177+ 6A85 32 D4 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 178+ 6A88 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 179+ 6A8B ED 79            OUT (C), A
