 155+ A1B2 DD 36 02 00      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_IDLE
 156+ A1B6 DD 36 03 78      LD (IX+ENT_POSX), START_PLAYER_X
 157+ A1BA DD 36 04 90      LD (IX+ENT_POSY), START_PLAYER_Y
 158+ A1BE DD 36 05 47      LD (IX+ENT_ATTR), WHITE | $40       ; Bright blanco
