 753+ A5B3 DD 35 09         DEC (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER)
 754+ A5B6 20 12            JR NZ, .peScaredNoFlip
 755+ A5B8 DD 36 09 08      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), 8
