1105+ A836 E6 F8            AND $F8
1106+ A838 32 D4 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1107+ A83B 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1108+ A83E ED 79            OUT (C), A
1109+ A840 C9               RET
