1242+ A8E5                  ; --- Auto-select sword mode segun stamina ---
1243+ A8E5 CD A6 AD         CALL SelectSwordMode
1244+ A8E8                  ; --- Dispatch segun SwordMode ---
1245+ A8E8 3A 37 B6         LD A, (SwordMode)
1246+ A8EB B7               OR A
1247+ A8EC 28 09            JR Z, .swordModeB
1248+ A8EE FE 01            CP 1
1249+ A8F0 28 3F            JR Z, .swordModeC
1250+ A8F2 FE 02            CP 2
1251+ A8F4 CA 5A A9         JP Z, .swordModeFree
