1440+ AA19 28 42            JR Z, .xOk
1441+ AA1B DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1442+ AA1E 32 C4 AA         LD (.tmpNewX), A
1443+ AA21 3A C2 AA         LD A, (.savedX)
1444+ AA24 DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
1445+ AA27 CD C7 AA         CALL CheckPlayerMonsterOverlap
