2486+ AFD7 CB 57            BIT 2, A
2487+ AFD9 28 07            JR Z, .paRndRight
2488+ AFDB 3A A7 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
2489+ AFDE ED 44            NEG
2490+ AFE0 18 03            JR .paRndSetDX
2491+ AFE2              .paRndRight:
