2495+ AFE8 ED 5F            LD A, R
2496+ AFEA CB 5F            BIT 3, A
2497+ AFEC 28 07            JR Z, .paRndDown
2498+ AFEE 3A A7 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
2499+ AFF1 ED 44            NEG
2500+ AFF3 18 03            JR .paRndSetDY
2501+ AFF5              .paRndDown:
