2543+ B02A CD A3 B9         CALL CheckEnemyCollision
2544+ B02D 28 0E            JR Z, .eXDone
2545+ B02F                  ; Colision → revertir X e invertir delta
2546+ B02F 3A C3 B0         LD A, (.savedEX)
2547+ B032 DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
