5469+ C037                  ; round-robin de ProcessEnemies (budget 2/frame) para los 3 monsters.
5470+ C037 CD 13 BD         CALL KillAllActiveNasties
5471+ C03A 3E 01            LD A, 1
5472+ C03C 32 3E B6         LD (MonstersActive), A
5473+ C03F CD BC C0         CALL ShuffleMonsterTypes
5474+ C042 DD 21 4F 81      LD IX, EntityTable + (SLOT_MONSTER0 * ENT_SIZE)
