7435+ CC05 10 F9            DJNZ .cfCol
7436+ CC07 E1               POP HL
7437+ CC08 11 20 00         LD DE, 32
7438+ CC0B 19               ADD HL, DE
7439+ CC0C 0D               DEC C
7440+ CC0D 20 EE            JR NZ, .cfRow
7441+ CC0F AF               XOR A                               ; Z
7442+ CC10 C9               RET
7443+ CC11              .cfBlocked:
