2237+ DA50 3D               DEC A
2238+ DA51 32 6C 82         LD (PickupFlashFrames), A
2239+ DA54 B7               OR A
2240+ DA55 C0               RET NZ                      ; aún no toca toggle
2241+ DA56                  ; Reset frame counter, decrementar toggles
