2243+ DA58 32 6C 82         LD (PickupFlashFrames), A
2244+ DA5B 3A 6B 82         LD A, (PickupFlashToggles)
2245+ DA5E 3D               DEC A
2246+ DA5F 32 6B 82         LD (PickupFlashToggles), A
