2532+ DBF5 C1               POP BC
2533+ DBF6 E1               POP HL
2534+ DBF7 C9               RET
2535+ DBF8              .gpkbFound:
2536+ DBF8 79               LD A, C                     ; A = id (1..8)
2537+ DBF9 C1               POP BC
2538+ DBFA E1               POP HL
2539+ DBFB C9               RET
