 228+ ED1A 38 05            JR C, .minOk
 229+ ED1C D6 05            SUB 5
 230+ ED1E 04               INC B
 231+ ED1F 18 F7            JR .divMin
 232+ ED21              .minOk:
 233+ ED21 78               LD A, B
 234+ ED22 21 14 EB         LD HL, MinHandPtrs
 235+ ED25 CD 23 EF         CALL DrawHandLine
