 414+ EE6C 3E 47            LD A, WHITE | $40
 415+ EE6E 32 0D 58         LD ($580D), A
 416+ EE71 32 0E 58         LD ($580E), A
 417+ EE74 32 2D 58         LD ($582D), A
 418+ EE77 32 2E 58         LD ($582E), A
 419+ EE7A 32 11 58         LD ($5811), A
 420+ EE7D 32 12 58         LD ($5812), A
 421+ EE80 32 31 58         LD ($5831), A
