 430+ EE91 20 05            JR NZ, .noFlashPlayer
 431+ EE93 3E 47            LD A, WHITE | $40
 432+ EE95 32 44 81         LD (EntityTable + ENT_ATTR), A
 433+ EE98              .noFlashPlayer:
