 438+ EE9E 32 0D 58         LD ($580D), A
 439+ EEA1 32 0E 58         LD ($580E), A
 440+ EEA4 32 2D 58         LD ($582D), A
 441+ EEA7 32 2E 58         LD ($582E), A
