 584+ EF4A 4F               LD C, A
 585+ EF4B 78               LD A, B
 586+ EF4C 32 FE EA         LD (ClockDebounce), A
 587+ EF4F 78               LD A, B
 588+ EF50
 589+ EF50 79               LD A, C
 590+ EF51 2F               CPL
 591+ EF52 A0               AND B
 592+ EF53 C8               RET Z
 593+ EF54
 594+ EF54 CB 47            BIT 0, A
